#: settings/herald.setting.php
msgid "Optional allowlist of webhook hostnames (e.g. hooks.slack.com, discord.com). When non-empty, only URLs whose host matches an entry (or a subdomain of it) are sent. Empty falls back to the private/reserved-address denylist."
